WEBVTT

00:00.465 --> 00:01.044
Kwenye video hii

00:01.044 --> 00:02.740
nitafanya mifano mingi ya maswali

00:02.740 --> 00:04.679
yanayojitokeza kwenye mitihani

00:04.679 --> 00:07.710
na bila shaka itakusaidia pamoja na njia yetu ya ugawanyikaji

00:07.710 --> 00:10.363
kwa sababu inakuhitaji kufanya maswali kama hili.

00:10.363 --> 00:12.243
Huu ni mfano mojawapo.

00:12.243 --> 00:14.802
Namba zote zinazogawika kwa 12 na 20

00:14.802 --> 00:17.509
pia zinagawika kwa:

00:17.509 --> 00:19.366
Mbinu ya kutumia hapa ni kutambua

00:19.366 --> 00:21.967
kwamba kama namba inagawika kwa 12 na 20,

00:21.967 --> 00:26.505
ni lazima igawike kwa kila hivi vigawo tasa.

00:26.505 --> 00:28.573
Sasa tutumie vigawo tasa

00:28.573 --> 00:30.674
vigawo tasa vya 12,

00:30.674 --> 00:32.635
tuone, 12 ni 2 mara 6.

00:32.635 --> 00:35.677
6 sio tasa kwahiyo 6 ni 2 mara 3.

00:35.677 --> 00:37.407
Kwahiyo hiyo ni tasa.

00:37.407 --> 00:39.527
Kwahiyo namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 12

00:39.527 --> 00:41.972
lazima iwe inagawika kwa 2 mara 2 mara 3.

00:41.972 --> 00:43.969
Kwahiyo vigawo tasa vyake lazima

00:43.969 --> 00:46.513
viwe na 2 mara 2 mara 3 ndani yake,

00:46.513 --> 00:48.580
namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 12

00:48.580 --> 00:51.353
Hapa sasa, namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 20

00:51.353 --> 00:53.200
lazima igawike kwa

00:53.200 --> 00:55.325
tutafute vigawo tasa vyake.

00:55.325 --> 00:57.181
2 mara 10

00:57.181 --> 00:59.503
10 ni 2 mara 5.

00:59.503 --> 01:01.662
Kwahiyo namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 20

01:01.662 --> 01:04.785
lazima pia igawike kwa

01:04.785 --> 01:06.445
2 mara 2 mara 5.

01:06.445 --> 01:07.618
Au njia nyingine ya kufanya

01:07.618 --> 01:12.006
ni lazima iwe na 2 mbili na 5 kwenye vigawo tasa vyake.

01:12.006 --> 01:13.644
Kama inagawika kwa zote

01:13.644 --> 01:17.021
inabidi iwe na 2 mbili, 3 na 5

01:17.021 --> 01:19.204
2 mbili na 3 kwenye 12,

01:19.204 --> 01:22.745
na kisha 2 mbili na 5 kwenye 20,

01:22.745 --> 01:24.445
na unaweza kuhakiki hii mwenyewe

01:24.445 --> 01:26.042
kwamba hii inagawika kwa zote.

01:26.042 --> 01:29.487
Ni dhahiri kwamba kama unaigawa kwa 20,

01:29.487 --> 01:30.695
ngoja niifanye kwa njia hii.

01:30.695 --> 01:31.636
Kuigawa kwa 20 ni kitu kile kile

01:31.636 --> 01:34.460
kama kuigawa kwa 2 mara 2 mara 5.

01:34.460 --> 01:35.493
takachopata ni

01:35.493 --> 01:37.037
hizi 2 zitaondoka

01:37.037 --> 01:38.476
hizi 5 zitzafutika

01:38.476 --> 01:40.404
Utabaki na 3.

01:42.818 --> 01:44.026
Kwahiyo ni wazi kua inagawika kwa 20

01:44.026 --> 01:47.357
na kama utahitaji kuigawa kwa 12,

01:47.357 --> 01:49.938
utaigawa kwa 2 mara 2 mara 3.

01:49.938 --> 01:51.517
Hii ni sawa kabisa na 12.

01:51.517 --> 01:53.282
Na namba hizi zitaondoka

01:53.282 --> 01:54.884
na utabakiwa na 5

01:54.884 --> 01:56.022
ambayo dhahiri inagawika kwa namba zote

01:56.022 --> 01:57.624
na namba hii hapa ni 60.

01:57.624 --> 01:59.761
NI 4 mara 3 jibu lake 12,

01:59.761 --> 02:01.653
mara 5 ni 60.

02:01.653 --> 02:04.497
Hii hapa kulia ni kigawe kidogo cha shirika

02:04.497 --> 02:06.564
cha 12 na 20

02:06.564 --> 02:08.178
Hii sio namba pekee

02:08.178 --> 02:10.801
ambayo inagawika kwa 12 na 20.

02:10.801 --> 02:12.961
Unaweza kuzidisha namba hii hapa kulia

02:12.961 --> 02:15.979
na vigawo vingine vyote.

02:15.979 --> 02:18.661
Naweza kuziita a, b na c,

02:18.661 --> 02:20.879
lakini aina hii ya namba ndogo

02:20.879 --> 02:22.864
ambayo inagaika kwa 12 na 20.

02:22.864 --> 02:25.024
Namba nyingine yoyote itagawika

02:25.024 --> 02:27.775
kwa namba zilezile kama hii namba ndogo.

02:28.843 --> 02:31.000
Baada ya kusema hayo, sasa tujibu maswali.

02:31.000 --> 02:33.763
Namba zote zinazogawika kwa 12 na 20

02:33.763 --> 02:35.446
pia zinagawika kwa:

02:35.446 --> 02:37.246
Sawa, hatujuia ni namba zipi hizi

02:37.246 --> 02:39.429
kwahiyo hatuwezi kulitolea maelezo.

02:39.429 --> 02:41.530
Zinaweza kuwa ni 1 au pengine hazipo

02:41.530 --> 02:43.132
kwasababu namba yaweza kuwa 60.

02:43.132 --> 02:44.305
Inaweza kua 120.

02:44.305 --> 02:46.012
Ni nani anayejua ni namba gani hii?

02:46.012 --> 02:49.309
Kwahiyo namba ambazo tunajua zinaweza kugawanywa

02:49.309 --> 02:50.133
kwenye hizi namba

02:50.133 --> 02:51.506
tunajua inaweza kua 2,

02:52.346 --> 02:53.593
tunajua kwamba 2 ni jibu halisi.

02:53.593 --> 02:54.951
2 inagawika kwenye

02:54.951 --> 02:56.925
2 mara 2 mara 3 mara 5.

02:56.925 --> 03:00.407
Tuanajua kwamba 2 mara 2 inagawika kwenye hiyo namba

03:00.407 --> 03:02.974
kwasababu tunayo 2 mara 2 hapa.

03:02.974 --> 03:05.284
Tunajua kwamba 3 inagawika kwenye hiyo namba

03:05.284 --> 03:08.808
Tunajua kwamba 2 mara 3 inagawika kwenye hiyo namba

03:08.808 --> 03:09.870
Kwahiyo namba ni 6.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.764
Hapa ninaziandika hizi namba.

03:10.764 --> 03:11.646
Hii ni 4

03:11.646 --> 03:12.935
Hii ni 6.

03:12.935 --> 03:14.851
Tunajua kwamba 2 mara 2 mara 3

03:14.851 --> 03:15.675
inagawika kwa kwenye hiyo namba

03:15.675 --> 03:17.672
Naweza kufanya kwa kila mlinganyo

03:17.672 --> 03:19.030
wa hizi namba hapa kulia.

03:19.030 --> 03:22.687
Tunajua kwamba 3 mara 5 inagawika kwenye hiyo namba

03:22.687 --> 03:24.592
Tunajua kwamba 2 mara 3 mara 5

03:24.592 --> 03:25.567
inagawika kwenye hiyo namba

03:25.567 --> 03:27.691
Kwa ujumla unaweza kuangalia hivi vigawo tasa

03:27.691 --> 03:30.013
na mlinganyo wowote wa hivi vigawo tasa

03:30.013 --> 03:34.147
unagawika kwenye namba yoyote ambayo inagawika

03:34.147 --> 03:35.795
kwa 12 na 20,

03:35.795 --> 03:37.270
kama hili lingekua swali la kuchagua,

03:37.270 --> 03:38.959
na namba za kuchagua zingekua

03:38.959 --> 03:41.427
7 na 9

03:44.381 --> 03:45.681
na 12

03:47.388 --> 03:48.851
na 8

03:48.851 --> 03:49.809
Ungeweza kusema,

03:49.809 --> 03:52.851
7 sio moja ya hivi vigawo tasa hapa

03:52.851 --> 03:55.811
9 ni 3 mara 3

03:55.811 --> 03:57.413
Hivyo nahitaji kuwa na 3 mbili hapa.

03:57.413 --> 03:58.910
Hapa ninayo 3 moja

03:58.910 --> 04:00.130
kwahiyo 9 sio sahihi

04:00.130 --> 04:01.338
7 sio sahihi, 9 sio sahihi.

04:01.338 --> 04:03.392
12 ni 4 mara 3

04:03.392 --> 04:04.751
au njia nyingine ya kulifanua hii ni

04:04.751 --> 04:07.619
12 ni 2 mara 2 mara 3

04:07.619 --> 04:09.975
Kuna 2 mara 2 mara 3

04:09.975 --> 04:11.820
kwenye orodha ya vigawo tasa

04:11.820 --> 04:16.082
vya vigawe vidogo vya shirika vya namba hizi mbili

04:16.082 --> 04:18.798
kwahiyo hii ni 12, na hii 12 ni sahihi.

04:18.798 --> 04:20.761
8 ni 2 mara 2 mara 2.

04:20.761 --> 04:23.269
Unahitaji 2 tatu kwenye vigawo tasa.

04:23.269 --> 04:24.823
Hatuna 2 tatu

04:24.823 --> 04:27.761
kwahiyo hii sio sahihi.

04:27.761 --> 04:29.805
Tufanye mfano mwingine

04:29.805 --> 04:31.523
ili kuhakikishia

04:31.523 --> 04:33.741
kwamba tunaelewa vema.

04:33.741 --> 04:35.098
Tudhanie kua tunajua,

04:35.098 --> 04:36.979
tunauliza swali lile lile.

04:38.811 --> 04:43.287
Namba zote zinazogawika kwa

04:43.287 --> 04:45.340
tuchukue namba mbili za sifa maalum

04:45.340 --> 04:49.188
iwe namba zinazogawika kwa 12

04:49.188 --> 04:51.829
na 9

04:54.394 --> 04:55.964
Tuiweke ya pekee zaidi

04:55.964 --> 04:58.926
9 na 24

04:58.926 --> 05:03.866
pia zinagawika kwa

05:03.866 --> 05:06.396
pia zinagawika kwa

05:06.396 --> 05:09.620
Na hapa tena tunafatafuta vigawo tasa

05:09.620 --> 05:11.582
Kimsingi tunatafuta vigawe vidogo kwa shirika

05:11.582 --> 05:13.010
vya 9 na 24

05:13.010 --> 05:14.763
Unatafuta vigawo tasa vya 9,

05:14.763 --> 05:16.829
ni 3 mara 3, na tumepata hivyo

05:17.699 --> 05:19.384
Vigawo tasa vya 24

05:20.524 --> 05:24.023
ni 2 mara 12.

05:24.023 --> 05:26.195
12 ni 2 mara 6,

05:26.195 --> 05:29.402
6 ni 2 mara 3.

05:29.402 --> 05:30.947
Kwahiyo namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 9

05:30.947 --> 05:33.525
ni lazima iwe na 9 kwenye vigawo vyake

05:33.525 --> 05:35.243
au kama umetafuta vigawo tasa vyake

05:35.243 --> 05:37.251
ungepata ni 3 mara 3,

05:37.251 --> 05:39.515
namba yoyote inayogawika kwa 24

05:39.515 --> 05:41.373
ni lazima iwe 2 tatu ndani yake

05:41.373 --> 05:45.042
kwahiyo ina 2 mara 2 mara 2

05:45.042 --> 05:46.737
na pia ina walau 3 moja hapa

05:46.737 --> 05:49.419
Na lazima tuwe na walau 3 moja kutoka kwenye 9

05:49.419 --> 05:50.405
Na tunayo.

05:50.405 --> 05:52.507
Kwahiyo namba hii hapa kulia inagawika

05:52.507 --> 05:55.398
kwa 9 na 24.

05:55.398 --> 05:57.245
Na namba hii hapa kulia ni 72.

05:57.245 --> 06:01.726
Hii ni 8 mara 9, jibu lake ni 72.

06:01.726 --> 06:03.502
Kama tungekua na majibu ya kuchagua kwa swali hili

06:03.502 --> 06:05.127
labda hili lingekua swali la majibu ya kuchagua

06:05.127 --> 06:07.046
Na majibu yangekua

06:07.046 --> 06:08.050
16

06:09.240 --> 06:10.343
27

06:12.694 --> 06:14.076
5

06:14.076 --> 06:15.128
11

06:16.084 --> 06:18.962
na 9.

06:18.962 --> 06:21.643
Kwahiyo kama ungakua unatafuta vigawo tas avya 16,

06:21.643 --> 06:25.876
ni 2 mara 2 mara 2 mara 2.

06:25.876 --> 06:27.159
Ni 2 kwenye kipeo cha 4.

06:27.159 --> 06:29.422
Kwahiyo hapa unahitaji 2 nne hapa.

06:29.422 --> 06:31.581
Hapa hatuna 2 nne.

06:31.581 --> 06:33.485
Ninamaanisha pangekua na namba nyingine hapa

06:33.485 --> 06:34.685
lakini hatujui ni namba zipi hizo.

06:34.685 --> 06:35.864
Hizi ndiyo namba pekee

06:35.864 --> 06:37.630
ambazo tunadhani ni vigawo tasa

06:37.630 --> 06:39.569
za namba inayogawika

06:39.569 --> 06:41.718
kwa 9 na 24.

06:41.718 --> 06:43.377
Kwahiyo, tunaweza kuiondoa 16

06:43.377 --> 06:44.677
Hatuna 2 nne hapa.

06:44.677 --> 06:49.578
27 ni sawa na 3 mara 3 mara 3,

06:49.578 --> 06:51.736
kwahiyo unahitaji 3 tatu kwenye vigawo tasa.

06:51.736 --> 06:53.037
Hatuna 3 tatu

06:53.037 --> 06:53.850
Tunazo 3 mbili tu.

06:53.850 --> 06:56.531
Kwa mara nyingine, futa hiyo

06:58.031 --> 06:59.091
5 ni namba tasa

06:59.091 --> 07:00.113
Hakuna 5 hapa

07:00.113 --> 07:01.112
Iondoe hiyo namba

07:01.112 --> 07:02.993
11, kwa mara nyingine, namba tasa

07:02.993 --> 07:04.153
Hakuna 11 hapa.

07:04.153 --> 07:05.593
Iondoe hiyo namba.

07:05.593 --> 07:08.752
9 ni sawa na 3 mara 3

07:08.752 --> 07:10.853
Nimegundua kwamba hili nijibu rahisi

07:10.853 --> 07:12.547
kwasababu ni wazi kwamba namba zinazogawika

07:12.547 --> 07:14.499
kwa 9 na 24 pia zinagawika kwa 9.

07:14.499 --> 07:16.007
Kwahiyo 9 ni namba sahihi

07:16.007 --> 07:17.274
lakini sijaichagua

07:17.274 --> 07:20.187
kwasababu ingeleta tatizo, lakini 9 ni sahihi

07:20.187 --> 07:22.474
na je ingekuaje kama

07:22.474 --> 07:25.017
8 ingekua moja ya jibu la kuchagua

07:25.017 --> 07:28.453
kwasababu 8 ni sawa na 2 mara 2amara 2

07:28.453 --> 07:31.437
na tuna 2 mara 2 mara 2 hapa

07:31.437 --> 07:33.074
4 inafaa hapa.

07:34.614 --> 07:35.651
Hii ni 2 mara 2.

07:35.651 --> 07:37.063
Hii ni 2 mara 2

07:37.063 --> 07:38.623
6 inafaa kwa sababu ni 2 mara 3.

07:38.623 --> 07:39.658
18 pia ni sahihi

07:39.658 --> 07:42.398
kwasababu 2 mara 3 mara 3.

07:42.398 --> 07:44.302
Kwahiyo namba yoyote katika mtiririko

07:44.302 --> 07:47.784
huu wa vigawo tasa itagawika

07:47.784 --> 07:51.221
kwenye namba ambayo inagawika kwa 9 na 24.

07:51.221 --> 07:53.484
Natumai hii haiwezi kukuchanganya.
